lumn elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0286a59\" data-id=\"0286a59\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c36d99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c36d99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0cm;line-height: normal;font-size: 11pt;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-style: normal;letter-spacing: normal;white-space: normal\"><span style=\"font-family: Rufina, sans-serif;font-size: 3em;letter-spacing: 0.55px;white-space: pre-wrap\">German Translation Expertise<\/span><span style=\"font-family: Rufina, sans-serif;font-size: 3em;letter-spacing: 0.55px;white-space: pre-wrap\"><\/span><\/p><\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97ddcc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"97ddcc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-variant-caps: normal; line-height: normal; font-style: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 13.5pt; color: rgb(13, 13, 13);\">German is the most widely spoken language in the European Union. With 130 million speakers who consider German their mother-tongue, it is an official language of 7 countries, including Germany, Austria, Switzerland, Belgium, Liechtenstein and Luxembourg. It is also an official language of the EU. There are sizeable German-speaking communities across Europe including Poland, France, the UK, Denmark, Sweden, Russia, and Hungary among others. In fact, German is the most spoken language on the European continent other than Russian.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-variant-caps: normal; line-height: normal; font-style: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 13.5pt; color: rgb(13, 13, 13);\">The shear size of the European Union and its marketplace is reason enough for any company interested in international markets to realize the significance of being able to communicate effectively in German. With its 28 member states and $5.3 billion in&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-style: italic;\">daily<\/span>&nbsp;trade between the United States and Europe, it\u2019s easy to see that fluent communications in German can undoubtedly attract numerous potential consumers in a rapidly growing market.<\/span><\/p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-variant-caps: normal; line-height: normal; font-style: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 13.5pt; color: rgb(13, 13, 13);\">Another 7.5 million German-speaking minorities live in 42 countries on every continent, including Antarctica! Emigration to North America from Germany in the 18<span style=\"line-height: 0; font-size: 13.5px; position: relative; top: -0.5em;\">th<\/span>&nbsp;and 19<span style=\"line-height: 0; font-size: 13.5px; position: relative; top: -0.5em;\">th<\/span>&nbsp;centuries brought sizeable German-speaking communities to the United States and Canada. Today, there are more than 1.4 million German speakers living in the United States and over 600,000 in Canada. German is also widely spoken in Germany\u2019s former African colony, Namibia.<\/span><\/p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-variant-caps: normal; line-height: normal; font-style: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 13.5pt; color: rgb(13, 13, 13);\">Finally, as a language with a long and deep cultural history, German has been the primary source language of a significant volume of important academic and scientific research, not to mention the giants of German literature and music.<\/span><\/p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-variant-caps: normal; line-height: normal; font-style: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 13.5pt; color: rgb(13, 13, 13);\">ABC Language Solutions has extensive expertise in translating and delivering effective translation services for use in Germany and German-speaking countries worldwide. We translate all kinds of documents from\/to German, including medical, legal, financial, scientific, business documents and many others.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-variant-caps: normal; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-variant-caps: normal; line-height: 19.260000228881836px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 13.5pt; font-style: normal; color: rgb(13, 13, 13);\">Whether you need the translation of a simple personal document translation or a highly technical report, ABC Language Solutions is ready to help you! We provide professional, quick, and certified German translation services that will help you communicate with confidence across the street or across the globe!<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element element