rmal; font-variant-caps: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 20.700000762939453px; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0d0d0d;\">Like any language, German has its own peculiarities, with different dialects, varying from Swiss German to Bavarian German, which is spoken in Austria. Translating documents into German can be a challenging task that demands professional translators and a thorough linguistic review and cultural understanding by a native language expert. The translator must fully understand the local terminology to avoid misunderstandings. We have a vast network of experienced linguists from Germany and North America who can provide high-quality German translation solutions while meeting your deadline and budget expectations. It is so important to understand and adequately represent the differences in the target language, so only translators with a firm grasp of regional culture or dialects can be trusted to create work that produces the intended effect. We highly recommend you contact a language professional, such as ABC Language Solutions, to discuss these specific services and ensure that your documents are correctly and accurately represented in German in your area of interest.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0cm; line-height: 16.866666793823242px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 20.700000762939453px; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0d0d0d;\">Our translators are native German speakers and experts in different fields such as legal, technical, medical, marketing, localization and many others. Whether you need a simple document translation service or have specific requirements, we have the solution to suit your needs. With our team of native German translators,<\/span><span lang=\"EN-CA\" style=\"font-s